INF3315 - Privacy Preserving Computation
Sebastian Mai

Layout
  src/code1.py        Survey queries (Task 1) and their differentially
                      private versions using the Laplace mechanism (Task 2)
  src/code1_test.py   Tests for code1.py
  src/a4_adapter.py
  src/test_a4.py
  src/survey.csv      Survey data
  src/pii.csv         PII data
  report/report.tex   Report source
  report.pdf          Compiled report

Requirements
  Python 3, numpy, pandas, pytest

Running the tests
  cd src
  pytest
